1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"conference-2025","section":"events","title":["以社会为现场","Society as a Site"],"date":"2025.11.06 — 11.09","status":["国际会议","International conference"],"summary":["2025社会创新设计国际会议暨米兰三年展中国展区闭幕会议，在福建屏南展开。社会设计、社会技术、社会叙事与社会生态构成四大议题。","The 2025 international conference on design for social innovation and closing conference of the Milan Triennale’s Chinese section took place in Pingnan."],"image":"/assets/editorial/conference.jpg","caption":["会议现场资料，乡土国际汇报 PDF 第12页。","Conference documentation, presentation p.12."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["11.06 / 四坪—龙潭","11.06 / Siping–Longtan"],"text":["从村落导览开始，在具体地方理解会议所讨论的社会现场。","The programme opened with a village tour, grounding the discussions in local places."]},{"title":["11.07 / 大食物馆","11.07 / Food Pavilion"],"text":["会议开幕与米兰三年展中国展区闭幕环节；围绕“国家与社会”“技术与社会”展开社会设计、社会技术讨论。","Opening and closing ceremonies were followed by Social Design and Social Technology sessions on state, society and technology."]},{"title":["11.08 / 前汾溪村","11.08 / Qianfenxi"],"text":["在宁德乡土学院讨论社会叙事与社会生态，涉及历史话语、生态系统与社会创新。","Sessions at Ningde Countryside School addressed social narrative and ecology, historical discourse and social innovation."]},{"title":["11.09 / 爱故乡书吧","11.09 / Love Hometown Bookbar"],"text":["青年学者论坛、大路学坊结题专场、乡土国际发布与硕博研习营开幕在此衔接。结题专场与新研习营的届次关系仍待核对。","The Young Scholars Forum, a Big Road Workshop conclusion, the Countryside International launch and study camp opening connected here. The workshop conclusion should not be confused with the newly opened camp’s outcomes."]}],"related":["camp-2025","milan-food","diverse-foods"],"sources":["conference"],"credits":["主办：中国美术学院视觉传播学院、中国国际贸促会建设行业分会中意创意产业委员会、中国美术学院美丽中国研究院、屏南乡村振兴研究院、中国美术学院乡土学院·宁德。嘉宾线上／线下参与方式及完整工作团队见原文。","Hosts include the School of Communication Design, CAA; the China–Italy Creative Industries Committee, CCPIT Construction Industry Branch; the Research Institute of Better China Initiative, CAA; the Pingnan Rural Revitalization Research Institute; and CAA Countryside School · Ningde. See the source for full credits and online/in-person participation."]}}]
